    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino-Might is a competitive couch co-op fighting game where you control a tiny-armed T-Rex in a prehistoric smackdown. Battle 2-4 players in fast-paced local and online multiplayer matches\u2014only one dino will survive extinction!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy your last moments in the prehistoric arena with friends or foes! Battle it out in 2-4 player matches, whether you're smackin\u2019 dinos on the couch or throwing down online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Play: Grab some controllers and challenge your crew! (Controllers required.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Play: Face off with friends or rivals using a keyboard or controller.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/bc72d9ac5355d44aeec235e78e33d4a2.avif?t=1743899503\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span><strong>Entertaining Tiny-Arm Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny arms, big impact! Every attack is a leap of faith\u2014jump at the right angle, commit to the strike, and take down your foes. Mistime it, and you\u2019re dino toast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, endless strategy. Bait opponents, chain attacks, or dominate the high ground\u2014how you fight is up to you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/27fa1eec549315673bcf6fc4fcde9014.poster.avif?t=1743899503\" width=589 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/27fa1eec549315673bcf6fc4fcde9014.webm?t=1743899503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adorable Dino Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your dino with a variety of colors and accessories. Feeling cowboy cute today? Or how about pierced punk? Well, in Dino-Might, you can change it up each game.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/67122cefee45e68de8d28bd2cf68c3d2.poster.avif?t=1743899503\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/67122cefee45e68de8d28bd2cf68c3d2.webm?t=1743899503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exciting Powerful Pickups</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, get that fireball before your opponent does! Use an array of game-changing pickups like fireballs, speed boosts, double jumps, and invisibility to gain the upper hand.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/ca7c7767bf233dd857e153768277013c.poster.avif?t=1743899503\" width=595 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/ca7c7767bf233dd857e153768277013c.webm?t=1743899503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Let Out Your Rawr!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOU CAN RAWR! Enough said.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/05afb4311b8c630d2fa8f92a6a5148f4.poster.avif?t=1743899503\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/05afb4311b8c630d2fa8f92a6a5148f4.webm?t=1743899503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino-Might is a competitive couch co-op fighting game where you control a tiny-armed T-Rex in a prehistoric smackdown. Battle 2-4 players in fast-paced local and online multiplayer matches\u2014only one dino will survive extinction!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy your last moments in the prehistoric arena with friends or foes! Battle it out in 2-4 player matches, whether you're smackin\u2019 dinos on the couch or throwing down online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Play: Grab some controllers and challenge your crew! (Controllers required.)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Play: Face off with friends or rivals using a keyboard or controller.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/bc72d9ac5355d44aeec235e78e33d4a2.avif?t=1743899503\" data-has-big width=800 height=193 /></span><strong>Entertaining Tiny-Arm Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny arms, big impact! Every attack is a leap of faith\u2014jump at the right angle, commit to the strike, and take down your foes. Mistime it, and you\u2019re dino toast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, endless strategy. Bait opponents, chain attacks, or dominate the high ground\u2014how you fight is up to you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/27fa1eec549315673bcf6fc4fcde9014.poster.avif?t=1743899503\" width=589 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/27fa1eec549315673bcf6fc4fcde9014.webm?t=1743899503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adorable Dino Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your dino with a variety of colors and accessories. Feeling cowboy cute today? Or how about pierced punk? Well, in Dino-Might, you can change it up each game.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/67122cefee45e68de8d28bd2cf68c3d2.poster.avif?t=1743899503\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/67122cefee45e68de8d28bd2cf68c3d2.webm?t=1743899503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exciting Powerful Pickups</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, get that fireball before your opponent does! Use an array of game-changing pickups like fireballs, speed boosts, double jumps, and invisibility to gain the upper hand.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/ca7c7767bf233dd857e153768277013c.poster.avif?t=1743899503\" width=595 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/ca7c7767bf233dd857e153768277013c.webm?t=1743899503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Let Out Your Rawr!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOU CAN RAWR! Enough said.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/05afb4311b8c630d2fa8f92a6a5148f4.poster.avif?t=1743899503\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613070/extras/05afb4311b8c630d2fa8f92a6a5148f4.webm?t=1743899503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Dino-Might is a couch co-op fighting game where you control a tiny-armed T-Rex in a prehistoric smackdown! Customize your look, pounce on your opponents, dodge pitfalls, and watch out for the incoming meteor shower in a wild battle for survival. Who will be the last dino standing?",
